            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Grandma of 14"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious. I added more celery for crunch, and used avocado mayonnaise, because that was what I had on hand. I served it to guests on croissants, and everyone loved it. I will make it often when I have leftover rotisserie chicken.",
            "datePublished": "2022-09-02T21:52:19.702Z"
          },
          {
